{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"\"Baeshra way use all too. Old tribe all scales, no need steel coats. Most hide use to build tool, homes. Bones help gardens, soups. Some weapons. Meat is eat. Much organs eat too. Some kept, gifts to seers. Teeth and claw. Depend on hunt. May be trophy. May be seer. May be alarm. All parts have use. Use brings honor to the hunted. The hunt bring honor to hunter.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T01:11:22.360000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739651595209408553","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
