{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"They look sadly, then begin to write something down: 'when I saved Amara with the big spell, there were many side effects. One made me learn a lot of new languages, but it also made me not be able to communicate in anything except common. Part of the rites involves duidic, but I can no longer speak it. It works just as good I think, but it feels wrong.'","created_at":"2020-08-03T01:14:04.447000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739652275051561050","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"\"Web learn again? Web teach Baeshra? Make feel right?\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T01:15:37.653000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739652665985859687","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
