{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"Baeshra looks over the meat. \"Seem wrong to sell to Night Wind and Wren... but to honor all meat... Baeshra need much salt. Keep long...er... easy with Baeshra pot...\" She drifts into silence thinking of the things she lost before snapping out of it. \"Much good meat. Can cook. Cooked food last long too. Share with tribe. All have food. Maybe Baeshra make... chilly. Share with tribe when Baeshra tell missed steak.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T01:25:31.247000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739655155699548191","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
